.TH start-cli-auth-passkey-remove 1  "remove "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-auth\-passkey\-remove \- Remove a passkey and close its connections
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli auth passkey remove\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPUBLIC_KEY\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove a passkey and close its connections
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPUBLIC_KEY\fR>
The passkey’s public key in PEM or DER Base64
